# Private disclosure terms, one per line. Proper nouns only: the generic
# vocabulary lives in tools/commit-rules/disclosure-patterns.mjs.
#
# npm install copies this file to .disclosure-terms.local, which is gitignored
# and never overwritten. Add the real names there, not here.
#
# A term also matches its plural and possessive forms, so add the base name only.
# CI reads the same list from the DISCLOSURE_TERMS repository secret.

# Employers and clients
Northwind Logistics
Acme Bank

# Products under an agreement
Project Polaris

# People
Jane Doe
